Dear ELLIPAL Community,

Some ideas arrive quietly, then refuse to leave.

Over time, one such idea kept surfacing =E2=80=94 in conversations, in feed=
back, in the way many of you naturally work: the desire for a desktop exper=
ience. Not to replace what already works, but to expand it. To make room fo=
r focus, for scale, for a different kind of control.

Today, that idea becomes part of ELLIPAL.

We=E2=80=99re introducing the ELLIPAL Desktop App =E2=80=94 thoughtfully de=
signed to extend your experience beyond mobile, into an environment where v=
isibility is sharper, navigation feels more fluid, and managing your digita=
l assets becomes more intuitive.

On a larger screen, everything changes. Portfolios are easier to interpret.=
 Activity is easier to track. Decisions feel less constrained. Whether you=
=E2=80=99re reviewing accounts, monitoring movements, or simply organizing =
your assets, the experience becomes calmer, clearer, and more deliberate.

The desktop app is available across Windows, macOS, and Linux, with support=
 for Chromium-based browsers =E2=80=94 giving you the flexibility to engage=
 with ELLIPAL in a way that fits naturally into how you work.

You can download and install it here: https://www.ellipalshop.io/

Once installed, simply follow the guided steps within the app to begin inte=
racting with your ELLIPAL environment.

This release marks a meaningful step forward, but more importantly, it rema=
ins open =E2=80=94 shaped by real use, real expectations, and real feedback=
. If there are moments that feel incomplete, or opportunities you believe w=
e should explore further, we want to hear them.

Because the best products are not just built and released =E2=80=94 they ar=
e refined, continuously, by the people who use them.

This is for you.

Warm regards,
ELLIPAL Team
